         <div type="edition" xml:lang="kan-Latn">
             <p>
                 <milestone type="pagelike" n="A" unit="face"/>
                 <lb n="1"/>svasti samasta-bhuvanāśraya
                 <lb n="2" break="no"/>-śrī-prithvī-vallabha-mahā-rājā
                 <lb n="3" break="no"/>dhirāja-paramēśvaraṁ parama
                 <lb n="4" break="no"/>-bhaṭṭārakaṁ satyāśraya kuḷa
                 <lb n="5" break="no"/>-tiḷakaṁ cāḷukyābharaṇaṁ śrī
                 <lb n="6" break="no"/>-mad-āhavamalla-dēvaṁ vija
                 <lb n="7" break="no"/>ya rājyam uttarōttarābhivri
                 <lb n="8" break="no"/>ddhi pravarddamānam ā candrā
                 <lb n="9" break="no"/>rkkaṁ saluttam ire</p>
             
             <p>tat-pāda-pa
                 <lb n="10" break="no"/>dmōpa-jīvi samadhi-gata-pa
                 <lb n="11" break="no"/>ñca-māhā-śabda-mahā-ma
                 <lb n="12" break="no"/>ṇdaḷēśvaraṁ nuḍidante gaṇḍaṁ sa
                 <lb n="13" break="no"/>mara-dhananyaya-vairikuḷā
                 <lb n="14" break="no"/>nktakam ari-ba<supplied reason="omitted">la</supplied>-dhūma-kētu
                 <lb n="15"/>yāhavamalan’ aṁka-kāṟiṁ
                 <lb n="16"/>śrīmatu sōma-permmāḍiyuṁ</p>
           
             <p>
                 <lb n="17"/>tat-kula-vadhuv anavarata-pa
                 <lb n="18" break="no"/>rama-kalyāṇābhy-udaya-saha
                 <lb n="19" break="no"/>śra-phala-bhōga-bhāga-bhāgiṇi dvitī
                 <lb n="20" break="no"/>ya-lakṣmī-samāneyar appa
                 <lb n="21"/>śrīmatu lakṣmib’ arasi
                 <lb n="22" break="no"/>yaru saka-varṣa 895 ne
                 <lb n="23" break="no"/>ya śrīmukha saṁvatsara vai
                 <lb n="24" break="no"/>śākha suddha pañcami guruvāra
                 

                 

             </p>
         
             
             
